SUMMARY:Property Committee Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Property Committee plays a vital role in fulfilling our congregation’s vision of environmental stewardship and creating a safe\, welcoming space for all. Tasked with maintaining our church buildings and grounds—including the church\, youth center\, farmhouse\, Rader Park\, and barn—we ensure everything is in working order\, up to code\, and repaired or replaced as needed. \nIn alignment with our mission\, we collaborate with other commissions to plan upgrades and additions that promote sustainability and environmental care. By thoughtfully managing our resources and facilities\, we aim to honor God’s creation while providing a safe\, inviting space for members\, staff\, and visitors alike.
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/property-committee-meeting-8/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Apostles UCC
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T203000
