CREATED:20260817T130342Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260817T130342Z
UID:38542-1789669800-1789677000@apostlesucc.org
SUMMARY:Mocktails & Meaning™: Data Centers in Lancaster County
DESCRIPTION:What could the rise of large-scale data centers mean for Lancaster County? 💻🌎 On Thursday\, September 17\, 2026 at 6:30 PM\, our September Mocktails & Meaning™ gathering at Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave.\, Lancaster\, PA will take a closer look at the growing conversation around data center development and the potential environmental\, economic\, infrastructure\, and community impacts. Darrell Lagace will lead the conversation\, offering a critical perspective on what these projects could mean for Lancaster County and the communities where they are proposed. \nWith data centers becoming a hot topic across our region\, this is a timely opportunity to learn more\, ask questions\, and consider what their growth could mean for our community and its future. We’ll be serving a nonalcoholic Blackberry Moscow Mule. Register Here: https://onrealm.org/apostlesucc/PublicRegistrations/Event?linkString=MTVmMTM2MDItYjI5OC00NjQ3LTgyMjktYjRhOTAwZDYzMmI4
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/mocktails-meaning-data-centers-in-lancaster-county/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Mocktails-Meaning-Flyer-Banner-Landscape-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
