SUMMARY:2026 Vaccine Clinic
DESCRIPTION:Church of the Apostles is partnering with Hillcrest Pharmacy to host a Flu & COVID-19 Vaccine Clinic following worship on Sunday\, September 27. Pharmacist Melissa Koehler will be on site to administer vaccines. \nTo ensure enough vaccines are available\, please register in advance. You can sign up by scanning the QR code\, visiting Realm under Events\, or by contacting the church office at (717) 392-5718 or office@apostlesucc.org. If registering through the office\, please let us know whether you plan to receive the flu vaccine\, the COVID-19 vaccine\, or both.
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/2026-vaccine-clinic/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-Vaccine-Clinic-Graphics.jpg
END:VEVENT
