SUMMARY:Malta Band of Lancaster Concert
DESCRIPTION:Experience an afternoon of live music on Sunday\, October 11 at 3 PM as The Malta Band performs the first concert in our newly renovated Sanctuary! 🎉 \n✨ Free admission\n♿ Fully wheelchair accessible\n🧸 Children’s corner available\n💛 Free-will offering benefits Apostles Academy \nCome experience the new Sanctuary and enjoy an afternoon of music with one of Lancaster County’s oldest concert bands. \n 
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/malta-band-of-lancaster-concert/
