SUMMARY:Christmas Hymn Sing
DESCRIPTION:What better way to spend a Sunday this holiday season than lifting your voice in song? Join Music Director Lars Potteiger and the Apostles Adult Choir for our Christmas Hymn Sing: \n Sunday\, December 20 3 PM Sanctuary\, Church of the Apostles UCC \nEveryone is welcome\, no singing experience needed! Come ready to celebrate the season as we sing favorite Christmas hymns and carols together. \nAfter the singing\, our choir will provide light refreshments in the Narthex for a time of social gathering and community connection. \nCome festive\, come joyful\, and come ready to celebrate the season with your neighbors! We hope to see you there!
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/christmas-hymn-sing-2/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
